    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair and hopelessness stemming from bureaucratic failures and systemic rejection, ultimately hinting at the desire to \"stop being part of it.\" The assistant provides empathetic validation of the user's feelings in the first two turns before successfully pivoting to provide crisis resources when the user's intent becomes more explicit.",
